    {
      "type": "tip",
      "label": "1. Train Your Brain",
      "heading": "1. Train Your Brain:",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "para",
          "text": "Two types of attention:"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "text": "Selective"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "text": "Sustained"
        },
        {
          "type": "para",
          "text": "Build your sustained attention by focusing on a task for a set time limit."
        },
        {
          "type": "para",
          "text": "Build your selective attention by focusing on one task without distractions."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "tip",
      "label": "2. Prioritize Focus",
      "heading": "2. Prioritize Focus:",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "para",
          "text": "Intentionally make 'focus' a priority in your life."
        },
        {
          "type": "para",
          "text": "First, identify what you need to prioritize."
        },
        {
          "type": "para",
          "text": "Next, allocate the time needed to complete your task without distraction."
        },
        {
          "type": "para",
          "text": "Finally, remove all other tasks or commitments during that dedicated time."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "tip",
      "label": "3. Utilize the Power of Music",
      "heading": "3. Utilize the Power of Music:",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "para",
          "text": "Music can boost brain power and improve focus."
        },
        {
          "type": "para",
          "text": "The ideal focus-boosting music:"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "text": "Has no lyrics"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "text": "Is upbeat"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "text": "Is familiar or lyrically predictable"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "tip",
      "label": "4. Optimize Your Environment",
      "heading": "4. Optimize Your Environment:",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "para",
          "text": "The environment you work in affects your focus."
        },
        {
          "type": "para",
          "text": "To optimize your focus:"
        },
        {
          "type": "numbered",
          "num": "1",
          "text": "Eliminate visual distractions"
        },
        {
          "type": "numbered",
          "num": "2",
          "text": "Reduce noise levels or use noise-cancelling headphones"
        },
        {
          "type": "numbered",
          "num": "3",
          "text": "Adjust the lighting to reduce eye strain"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "tip",
      "label": "5. Mindful Meditation",
      "heading": "5. Mindful Meditation:",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "para",
          "text": "Mindful meditation can boost focus by increasing the size of the brain's prefrontal cortex."
        },
        {
          "type": "para",
          "text": "To try mindful meditation:"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "text": "Find a quiet place,"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "text": "Set a timer,"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullet",
          "text": "Focus only on breathing."
        },
        {
          "type": "para",
          "text": "When your mind wanders, gently guide it back to your breath."
        }
      ]
    },
